  {
    "id": "emails/03_phase2-sequencing-proposal.txt#L42",
    "text": "repeating a plan that had not been agreed with you."
  },
  {
    "id": "emails/03_phase2-sequencing-proposal.txt#L186",
    "text": "Rather than delivering all four fresh categories together in one go-live, we would"
  },
  {
    "id": "emails/03_phase2-sequencing-proposal.txt#L187",
    "text": "deliver produce and dairy first, then chilled ready meals, then bakery. Three smaller"
  },
  {
    "id": "emails/03_phase2-sequencing-proposal.txt#L188",
    "text": "go-lives roughly six weeks apart."
  },
  {
    "id": "emails/03_phase2-sequencing-proposal.txt#L190",
    "text": "The advantage is that value starts landing earlier and each wave de-risks the next. The"
  },
